:"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41107},{"id":1789873650619,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788707117970,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41108},{"id":1789873650621,"sender":"character","text":"阿蘅，你说，为夫这般陪他玩，可还算威风？","timestamp":1788707117971,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41109},{"id":1789873650622,"sender":"me","text":"嗯…夫君好厉害","timestamp":1788707249899,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41110},{"id":1789873650624,"sender":"me","text":"好强好美…","timestamp":1788707257102,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41111},{"id":1789873650628,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅还想听","timestamp":1788707264783,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41112},{"id":1789873650630,"sender":"me","text":"夫君不是最喜欢吃活人脑髓？","timestamp":1788707283522,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41113},{"id":1789873650631,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅这是要把为夫的老底都翻出来。","timestamp":1788707318509,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41114},{"id":1789873650634,"sender":"character","text":"为夫最爱的，不是那脑髓本身，而是撬开头盖骨那一瞬间的声响。像开一个熟透的椰子，清脆利落。","timestamp":1788707318510,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41115},{"id":1789873650636,"sender":"character","text":"然后，用为夫的鬼爪，轻轻探进去…那脑髓温热、滑腻，像上好的豆腐脑，却又带着活人独有的血腥气。","timestamp":1788707318511,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41116},